<main><section class="contact-hero"><div class="container narrow"><p class="eyebrow gold-text">VESTIGE VAPES</p><h1>Contact</h1><p>Questions? Product enquiries or need help with an order?<br>Effortless communication and personalised service...just for you.<br><span class="contact-hero-signoff">Connect with Vestige.</span></p></div></section><section class="contact-section"><div class="container contact-grid"><div class="contact-card"><span class="feature-number">01</span><h2>Instagram</h2><p>Follow or message Vestige Vapes through the official Instagram account.</p><a class="btn btn-gold" href="https://www.instagram.com/vestigeltdmp/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Open Instagram</a></div><div class="contact-card"><span class="feature-number">02</span><h2>General enquiries</h2><p>For product, order, delivery or general enquiries, contact Vestige Vapes by e-mail or Instagram.</p><p class="contact-detail">E-mail: <strong><a href="mailto:orders@vestigeltd.co.za">orders@vestigeltd.co.za</a></strong></p><p class="contact-detail">Instagram: <strong>@vestigeltdmp</strong></p></div></div></section></main><footer class="footer"><div class="container footer-inner"><div>© 2026 Vestige Ltd · Vestige Vapes</div><div><a href="/">Home</a> · <a href="https://www.instagram.com/vestigeltdmp/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">@vestigeltdmp</a></div></div></footer></body></html>
